            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Years of Enrico Fermi</strong><br>\nEnrico Fermi was born in Rome, Italy, on September 29, 1901. As a child, Fermi displayed an exceptional aptitude for mathematics and physics, which was noticed by his family and teachers. His passion for these subjects was spurred by a personal tragedy—the loss of his brother—which drove him to immerse himself in academic studies as a source of solace and purpose.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Academic Beginnings</strong><br>\nFermi's academic career began at the University of Pisa, where he was known for his incredible intellectual capacity. He was awarded a doctorate in physics in 1922 for his work on X-ray emissions. Fermi's early achievements set a precedent for his future contributions to the field of nuclear physics, which would later change the course of history.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Development of Quantum Theory</strong><br>\nDuring the 1920s and early 1930s, Fermi was instrumental in advancing quantum theory. He introduced the statistical methods necessary for understanding subatomic particles, known as Fermi-Dirac statistics. These concepts helped to explain the behavior of electrons in atoms and laid the groundwork for future technological advances in various fields, including electronics and energy.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
